--- !u!114 &311527291
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 311527289}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>THE TARGET</b>  Normal players win by reaching the target exactly or
    voting out every imposter. Imposters win when moves run out or they reach parity
    after a vote or departure. An exact hit wins even on the final move.\n\n<b>YOUR
    TURN</b>  Choose one of three private dice, then add or subtract it. A number
    move spends one shared move. Overshoots and negative scores are legal. On timeout,
    the server picks a die and sign. You start with one skip per four players, rounded
    up. A skip spends your turn and preserves shared moves.\n\n<b>SABOTAGE</b>  Each
    imposter gets one use per round. Forced Block (one charge) skips an upcoming
    turn. Cursed Dice (two charges) biases two dice and leaves one fair. Both can
    target yourself before the roll. Lucky Shift (one team charge) moves the target
    by 1\u20135 in either direction, with a short grace period for the current player.
    A shift cannot set the target to the current score.\n\n<b>DISCUSS AND VOTE</b> 
    After each round, vote for a living player or Skip Ejection. No ballot is an
    abstention. A winning or tied skip means no ejection. Tied suspects face up to
    three runoffs. Three identical tied results can trigger a random ejection. Ejected
    players become spectators. Use external voice and stay silent after ejection."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
